<title>GERMANY: German Dec engineering orders down 13 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>German Dec engineering orders down 13 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering orders fell by 13 percent in real terms in December 1996 from the same 1995 month, the engineering industry association VDMA said.</p>
<p>In the final quarter of 1996 orders were down five percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>The VDMA statement gave the following data</p>
<p>    Dec	   change in pct   1st-qtr	  change in pct</p>
<p>    overall	    -13	  overall		-5</p>
<p>    of which German  -10	  of which German    -2</p>
<p>		 foreign -16	  foreign		-7</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
